The AI Style Atlas by Futurepedia (https://www.futurepedia.io/resources/ai-style-atlas/view) states no license.

This skill reproduces the atlas style prompts, descriptions, poster images and the overview video with credit, and links back to every entry, at the Subclip owner's request. The Subclip recipes and checks are written in our own words.

Because the atlas states no license, treat the license of the reproduced material as "Not stated". Creator permission has not been confirmed. Contact the maintainers to request removal at any time.
